#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:4
#: 9b8916bc2aa945ea9b57605dff48d7a8
msgid "Team accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:6
#: e66929a6640c4a6aae3ebbd270b338b9
msgid "A Team lets you work together with your coworkers: invite them, share projects and spend credits from one shared balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:8
#: 41a2810a41794ae18f48504ef481d160
msgid "Open **Team** in the main menu on the left (sidebar)."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:11
#: a6c9717ceab14007be7afd63dd55d7fe
msgid "We highly encourage you to use a Team if you work with other coworkers and manage multiple projects. Feel free to contact our support, so we can assist you in setting up a Team workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:15
#: d80d02821aa74617acec8dc94d309ddb
msgid "How it works"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:17
#: b8280b92074346afab245f1025c533b2
msgid "There are two roles in a Team:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:19
#: e408d17831a1411c8ebbaab317d868ac
msgid "**Admin** – invites users and manages the Team balance. The Admin's balance is the Team's balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:20
#: 4dfefead44a84b7c8a76f74990a482cf
msgid "**User** – joins the Team by invitation and spends the Team's credits."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:24
#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 5b7333d61f48434483f9ebf6e1918e70
#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Invite team members"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:26
#: c16503f88cd944e7a57d77ab66132d8a
msgid "Enter the user's email in **Invite team members**."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:27
#: ed01ccd1efdb40a7b0a627a1410376fe
msgid "Click **Send invite**. The user receives the invitation by email."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:28
#: ee9f1120af9c4ba0bd1ebc94a7b47796
msgid "Until the user accepts it, they are shown in the members list as **Pending invitation**."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:39
#: a03b96492da348b39fb5dd1d9a26a167
msgid "If the user is not registered at Mapflow yet, they can join the Team after signing up."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:43
#: 936165d5fa104d28a63f2f10235ca6ec
msgid "Join a Team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:45
#: a15ae53113bb4fcabfe6e024724d7b59
msgid "The invited user sees the invitation at the top of the **Team** page."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:46
#: 2fae8c0d431a496f8ea9865e2e3b45a7
msgid "Click **Accept** to join the Team, or **Decline** to reject the invitation."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Accept the invitation to the Team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:56
#: b27eafa0991d4b278b522754b802b385
msgid "After joining the Team:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:58
#: 1bb79e52862f4615a6c1f8ac8ff2697f
msgid "You spend the Team's credits."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:59
#: 842f0993a4744608bd4bc57d70022d55
msgid "Your personal balance stays untouched."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:60
#: 49cb252f5b754140a333e64351c2bf52
msgid "You can't create your own Team as long as you stay in this one."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:64
#: fc7d9f63a0ae4e84bcb142be58b278d3
msgid "Manage Team balance"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:66
#: a4dfc47f538447209e487f829e73b513
msgid "The Admin manages the balance of the whole Team:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:68
#: edaf073e7ec2483ba785460ab881c913
msgid "**Add credits** (**+**) – move credits from the Admin's balance to a user."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:69
#: c2947424cfa94b23b9d24ee20fbd4de3
msgid "**Withdraw credits** (**-**) – take credits back from a user to the Admin's balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Add or withdraw member's credits"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:79
#: 02182d28910843238b6e0516b7563819
msgid "At the top of the page you can see:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:81
#: 4abb6f1a26a74f24890355a8726cc07e
msgid "**Credits left** – credits remaining in the Team. Click **+** to top up the Team balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:82
#: 55d8c99769074580a75b9341c7036d48
msgid "**Credits used** – credits spent by the Team."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:83
#: a5990687d15541ba89f21d0efa146c30
msgid "**Members** – number of Team members."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:85
#: ecefeeb1666148b88f16228dbc35fb4a
msgid "The members list shows each member's role, credits **Used** and credits **Left**."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:87
#: 5a36fb1e8a064de48032f48cdd5a7d4a
msgid "Both your Team balance and personal balance are displayed in the header."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:90
#: 074052e21cdb4f9ba58f5141fd09742c
msgid "If your Team account is switched to area-based billing, the only difference is that the balance is managed in sq. km."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:94
#: b27eafa0991d4b278b522754b802b385
msgid "Project sharing in the Team"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:96
#: f1f8dc515cd14695834a9b6f310501c3
msgid "You can share your project with anyone in the Team and assign his role as needed. Go to the `Projects <https://app.mapflow.ai/en/projects>`_. Click on a dot menu icon in a project card -- Share."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:None
#: 552a99022642454596b16478ae66f4a6
#: e6edc7bbd9c140bd859189e54e6b5d59
msgid "Share project"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:106
#: dfde578fcf4e4e5bad617a0c11da6689
msgid "Select your coworkers or toggle \"Anyone in the team\" if you want to share with all of them."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:114
#: d50631b8f0214fdbad1523587850793d
msgid "There are four types of the project user's role that can be assigned to your coworkers:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:116
#: 7652b357a4ea46e2ba9f489ff05ecf41
msgid "**readonly** - can view the project history and the results"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:117
#: 6c2f27acf5994eabab7f252b2c5383b4
msgid "**contributor** – can run the workflows in the project"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:118
#: db4550eb101d442181a134cfb09fdb2d
msgid "**maintainer** – can run and edit the workflows, and share projects with users (up to maintainer role)"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:119
#: 8bc4c707799943ef9154949a6d2180d6
msgid "**owner** – full rights to edit all roles in the project"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:121
#: e3eca4be191f4cc9ad8ce9f97fbda77a
msgid "Your collaborators will see the new shared projects in their dashboard and use them according to the role assigned."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:124
#: cc230419b45c4efd856f7c53202db87f
msgid "You can also share your project with any users outside your team for the view-only access. Go to the Project -- Share and enter the existing Mapflow user's email. If the new user is not registered at Mapflow.ai, invite him to register first."
msgstr ""
